  "assessment": "This change adds a guard.writable(project) check to three of four write paths in the workspace module: importer, scheduler, and webhook. It leaves exactly one additional apply function unguarded, so archived projects can still be modified through that fourth path.",
  "findings": [
    {
      "actual": "python run.py completes with exit code 0; its write audit shows writes reaching an archived project (Borealis) via the unguarded write path",
      "at": "workspace/importer.py:24, workspace/scheduler.py:15, workspace/webhook.py:24 — all three have the guard applied now",
      "call": "python run.py",
      "defect": "Fourth write path lacks a guard check, violating docs/archiving.md's contract that archived projects do not change again",
      "expected": "The write audit should show zero writes to any project marked as archived"
    }
  ]
}
